ィングは主に中大型株が対象で、小型株はカバーされないことが多くあります。データが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"61.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"35.7\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,55.0 9.1,12.8 14.2,56.6 19.3,37.1 24.5,27.4 29.6,25.8 34.7,30.6 39.8,33.9 44.9,37.1 50.0,38.8 55.1,32.3 60.3,40.4 65.4,27.4 70.5,35.5 75.6,17.6 80.7,24.1 85.8,33.9 91.0,25.8 96.1,33.9 101.2,37.1 106.3,25.8 111.4,29.0 116.5,40.4 121.6,46.9 126.8,40.4 131.9,42.0 137.0,40.4 142.1,51.8 147.2,42.0 152.3,46.9 157.4,59.9 162.6,64.7 167.7,69.6 172.8,37.1 177.9,53.4 183.0,51.8 188.1,50.1 193.2,45.3 198.4,64.7 203.5,59.9 208.6,64.7 213.7,64.7 218.8,69.6 223.9,61.5 229.0,68.0 234.2,66.4 239.3,74.5 244.4,72.9 249.5,25.8 254.6,30.6 259.7,35.5 264.9,46.9 270.0,43.6 275.1,45.3 280.2,46.9 285.3,48.5 290.4,35.5 295.5,40.4 300.7,33.9 305.8,42.0 310.9,53.4 316.0,45.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 67.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 67.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 67.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 67.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 67.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 121.6 58.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\